    "updated_at": "2022-03-08T17:22:56Z",
    "body": "I think jam1garner/owo-colors#45 will be an issue. Per that issue, [colored](https://crates.io/crates/colored) would handle this correctly. Nu also has a [fork of ansi_term](https://crates.io/crates/nu-ansi-term), but I'd rather not depend on that. Alternatively, something custom or forking ansi_term could integrate the prompt shell escape handling, but I'd rather avoid that.",
