    "updated_at": "2022-03-22T20:24:14Z",
    "body": "While this is likely too late since a linked PR has already been created, I did just find an alternative by Sergio Benitez (of Rocket) called [yansi](https://github.com/SergioBenitez/yansi).\r\n\r\nThat repository has not seen updates in a while, but Sergio commented on an issue less than two weeks ago confirming that the project is not abandonware.",
