    "created_at": "2022-03-24T00:19:14Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-03-24T00:19:14Z",
    "body": "> While this is likely too late since a linked PR has already been created, I did just find an alternative by Sergio Benitez (of Rocket) called [yansi](https://github.com/SergioBenitez/yansi).\r\n> \r\n> That repository has not seen updates in a while, but Sergio commented on an issue less than two weeks ago confirming that the project is not abandonware.\r\n\r\nMy PR is by no means an obligation/choice, even if it isn't used it's a good reference for what parts of the codebase need to be reworked when switching color libraries. So absolutely not too late to consider alternatives",
